# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — PackageBuilder Step9 相对 project-dir 导致 tar 输出路径错位 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-28
# Software: hamlib 4.7.1（任何用相对 --project-dir 调用打包流水线的包）
# Gate: submit / packaging_present（archives/<l>/<pkg>/<ver>/packaging/*.tar.gz）
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: draft-hamlib-4.7.1-packagebuilder-relative-project-dir-tar-fail
title: PackageBuilder Step9 用相对 project-dir 时 tar 输出路径被 cwd 解析错位，报 No such file or directory 却仍写 .packaged
trigger_tool: package_builder / ohc package
phase: packaging
error_signature: 打包失败: .*\.tar\.gz|tar: .*\.tar\.gz: No such file or directory
severity: 2
category: toolchain|workflow
match_keywords: package_builder, step9_tarball, tar czf, project-dir, relative path,
  packaging, .packaged, No such file or directory
keywords: PackageBuilder, package_cli, --project-dir, tar czf, cwd, packaging_present,
  hamlib, .packaged
approach: 以绝对路径调用（--project-dir "$(pwd)"）；框架侧应 Path(...).resolve() 后再拼
  输出路径并检查 tar 返回码。
root_cause: step9_tarball() 里 tar_gz = self.packaging_dir / name 是相对路径（project-dir
  为 "." 时），而 subprocess.run(..., cwd=self.pkgdir) 已把工作目录切到
  packaging/pkg-<name>/，相对输出路径被解析为 .../packaging/pkg-<name>/archives/...（不存在）。
verification: 相对 → ❌ 打包失败；绝对 → ✅ 78880KB 主包 + 36335035B debug 包（hamlib 4.7.1）。
rec_approach: PackageBuilder.__init__ 对 pdir 做 resolve()；step9 输出路径 resolve()；
  tar 非 0 返回时不写 .packaged 且打印 stderr。
doc: 无（待 promote 后生成）

related: hamlib 4.7.1 submit 自检 packaging_present 需要该 tar.gz；K41/E050（HMDFS
  符号链接）同为打包流水线平台的坑。
